{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Your First Day</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/2985783a3991b0bf212e17e214b402fc.poster.avif?t=1760527368\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/2985783a3991b0bf212e17e214b402fc.webm?t=1760527368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/2985783a3991b0bf212e17e214b402fc.mp4?t=1760527368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a janitor in a secret underground facility, guided by ANNA, an AI with a childlike voice. Your job: clean biological waste and worse. Every task is a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Unknown</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/ccfbb086b8ddf59bb683b9722c0be97c.poster.avif?t=1760527368\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/ccfbb086b8ddf59bb683b9722c0be97c.webm?t=1760527368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level hides a unique, immortal entity that wants you dead. Some stalk silently; others attack without warning. Hide, run, and clean\u2014or perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Dread</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/8ef503f21addf9077d12901412117e50.poster.avif?t=1760527368\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/8ef503f21addf9077d12901412117e50.webm?t=1760527368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/8ef503f21addf9077d12901412117e50.mp4?t=1760527368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility\u2019s cold, illogical design amplifies your loneliness. Inspired by Control and SCP, every corner holds surreal horror. Will you survive your shift?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/cf4330498ca2c8a673b9798ed4a5c47e.poster.avif?t=1760527368\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/cf4330498ca2c8a673b9798ed4a5c47e.webm?t=1760527368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/cf4330498ca2c8a673b9798ed4a5c47e.mp4?t=1760527368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042150?t=1760527368","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042150?t=1760527368","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/a307fd2db1c513c4d06f1aad35b938df8d97a8fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760527368","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/a307fd2db1c513c4d06f1aad35b938df8d97a8fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760527368","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id